      "writtenOn": "2023-09-01T22:04:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You could use this target on git_master sdk_gphone_x86_64-userdebug. The emulator system image artifact is called sdk-repo-linux-system-images-*, for example it should look like this one:\nhttps://android-build.corp.google.com/builds/submitted/10440114/sdk_gphone_x86_64-userdebug/latest/sdk-repo-linux-system-images-10440114.zip\n\nAfter downloading please create an AVD (either from Android Studio or with a script), then unzip and overwrite the image in ~/Android/Sdk/system-images/[path/to/your/image/folder] where [path/to/your/image/folder] would depend on what is written in your AVD config (or you could just modify the avd config.ini and change system image path).\n\nPlease try to boot the emulator with command line \"-feature -Vulkan\". When booted please open chrome, browse a website and make sure it doesn\u0027t crash or launch vulkan. If you hit other issues please let me know.",
      "parentUuid": "dafd9d3e_e7b65cfa",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 20,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 24,
        "endChar": 9
